WEBVTT

00:06:57.636 --> 00:07:00.436
It sounds professional, very suit and tie.

00:07:01.196 --> 00:07:03.596
But I'm going to tell you a secret.

00:07:03.916 --> 00:07:05.316
It means tattoo.

00:07:05.716 --> 00:07:07.076
(Laughter)

00:07:07.076 --> 00:07:11.356
Micropigmentation is the act
of implanting pigment into the dermis,

00:07:11.356 --> 00:07:14.716
which is the definition of a tattoo,
but it sounds nicer, doesn't it,

00:07:14.716 --> 00:07:15.916
a bit less scary.

00:07:17.916 --> 00:07:19.916
The difference appears to come

00:07:19.916 --> 00:07:23.996
in the fact that micropigmentation
is designed to fade,

00:07:23.996 --> 00:07:26.756
and it's really designed
for the tattooing of eyebrows,

00:07:26.796 --> 00:07:28.156
lips and eyeliner,

00:07:28.156 --> 00:07:32.076
and it's designed to fade
and facilitate a regular top up.